{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-72","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：不可公度量与可公度量与中项无理线段","englishTitle":"If two medial areas incommensurable with one another be added together, the remaining two irrational straight lines arise, namely either a second bimedial or a side of the sum of two medial areas.","book":10,"number":72,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.72","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.72/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":72,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-72@raw-7784a7d0373e8f44","contentId":"euclid-10-72","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7784a7d0373e8f44b77bf00c42e01e987c448037e3ed60f2a0441445e3b59f66","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-72.statement","euclid-10-72.construction.1","euclid-10-72.proof.1","euclid-10-72.proof.2","euclid-10-72.construction.2","euclid-10-72.proof.3","euclid-10-72.proof.4","euclid-10-72.proof.5","euclid-10-72.proof.6","euclid-10-72.proof.7","euclid-10-72.proof.8","euclid-10-72.proof.9","euclid-10-72.proof.10","euclid-10-72.proof.11","euclid-10-72.proof.12","euclid-10-72.proof.13","euclid-10-72.proof.14","euclid-10-72.conclusion","euclid-10-72.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-72.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-72","revisionId":"euclid-10-72@raw-7784a7d0373e8f44","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5311c475856820ee339595fae9921b9083833e7a0b6e0f4246d657338005b650","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two medial areas incommensurable with one another be added together, the remaining two irrational straight lines arise, namely either a second bimedial or a side of the sum of two medial areas."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果将两个中项无理线段个区域不可公度相加,则产生另外两个无理线段个区域,即第二个双中项无理线段个区域或两个中项无理线段个区域之和的一面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-72.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-72","revisionId":"euclid-10-72@raw-7784a7d0373e8f44","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b6229cf4fd53d6b496c46dea315880714f5ab69d12b8d43c86ffc362ef10748d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let two medial areas AB, CD incommensurable with one another be added together; I say that the side of the area AD is either a second bimedial or a side of the sum of two medial areas."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让我们把两个中项无理线段个区域AB,CD,不可公度个区域相互加在一起;我说,AD区域的另一边是第二个双中项无理线段个区域,或者是两个中项无理线段个区域之和的一边。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-72.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-72","revisionId":"euclid-10-72@raw-7784a7d0373e8f44","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"23202ee9edb4dd77632dea248cfd01ab21324d0ed1551171149d59d388c022f2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For AB is either greater or less than CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB中,有的大于,有的少于CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-72.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-72","revisionId":"euclid-10-72@raw-7784a7d0373e8f44","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9a8684a4158063b5b6998c3463d2a5a1811b08c950dde405b261ac9782b2e264","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, if it so chance, let AB be greater than CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,如果机会如此,AB比CD要多。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-72.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-72","revisionId":"euclid-10-72@raw-7784a7d0373e8f44","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cbe2d054cfde32039853ea3788e4bf603d5ba41c3834223893be5247f582788b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the rational straight line EF be set out, and to EF let there be applied the rectangle EG equal to AB and producing EH as breadth, and the rectangle HI equal to CD and producing HK as breadth."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将有理线段 EF卫星设定为EF卫星,将矩形 EG卫星设定为AB卫星,将EH卫星设定为宽度,将矩形 HI卫星设定为宽度,将HK卫星设定为宽度。（相关点与线段：CD）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-72.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-72","revisionId":"euclid-10-72@raw-7784a7d0373e8f44","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6ae0b53b10b093654a08b2da7e9e17f7781402bb8d6bbc52aaf231ab19b3e0e8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since each of the areas AB, CD is medial, therefore each of the areas EG, HI is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于AB区域中,CD区域为中项无理线段个,因此,EG区域中,HI区域也是中项无理线段个。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-72.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-72","revisionId":"euclid-10-72@raw-7784a7d0373e8f44","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"55e9d0275dd00562d418b97db913707a3aa9c9fe1b2b7557af52794727089f2a","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And they are applied to the rational straight line FE, producing EH, HK as breadth; therefore each of the straight lines EH, HK is rational and incommensurable in length with EF. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"适用于有理线段 FE,宽度扩大EH HK;因此,EH直线的每条长度为有理和不可公度,长度为EF。 [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-72.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-72","revisionId":"euclid-10-72@raw-7784a7d0373e8f44","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4d5d818b307b02e9ab4fed73306dbc3e523b939c80a8d2646b60f3af55960ebd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AB is incommensurable with CD, and AB is equal to EG, and CD to HI, therefore EG is also incommensurable with HI."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是不可公度,CD,AB等于EG,CD至HI,因此EG也是不可公度,HI。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-72.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-72","revisionId":"euclid-10-72@raw-7784a7d0373e8f44","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e6e1bbd436e9fa21eb297012783f12ffb3f11082ca555ca6f612ea3d5d729aaf","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as EG is to HI, so is EH to HK; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore EH is incommensurable in length with HK. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,EG比HI等于EH比HK,因此,EH比EG等于HK；EG 与 HI 之比等于 EH 与 HK 之比；上述对应量不可公度。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-72.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-72","revisionId":"euclid-10-72@raw-7784a7d0373e8f44","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"76633ebe70f5af8e9b3b5de66b872002ab52922a962307d29cce067880fbce94","citations":["euclid-10-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore EH, HK are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore EK is binomial. [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EH,HK是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;EK是二项无理线段。 [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-72.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-72","revisionId":"euclid-10-72@raw-7784a7d0373e8f44","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"969c11b383ecaefc0aa81baf7ced666dd05a4daea04d0cd971f3ef199dff5d70","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on EH is greater than the square on HK either by the square on a straight line commensurable with EH or by the square on a straight line incommensurable with it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但EH的正方形比HK的正方形还要大,或者在可公度直线上正方形比EH直线上不可公度,或者在正方形直线上不可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-72.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-72","revisionId":"euclid-10-72@raw-7784a7d0373e8f44","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"211b438900f31450b5162ed6eaa433e73e4ad6ae6778e0e387c688314014d464","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, let the square on it be greater by the square on a straight line commensurable in length with itself."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,让正方形机在正方形机上 以长度可公度直线上 本身来放大"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-72.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-72","revisionId":"euclid-10-72@raw-7784a7d0373e8f44","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4bee70084ebfbca4dd3ad8b9ad395a5e6313615c56accf20502a072438586b08","citations":["euclid-10-def-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now neither of the straight lines EH, HK is commensurable in length with the rational straight line EF set out; therefore EK is a third binomial. [[X. Deff. II. 3](/principles/euclid-10-def-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,EH线和HK线都不到长度可公度,有理线段、EF线已经确定,因此,EK线是第三个二项无理线段线。 [[X. Deff. II. 3](/principles/euclid-10-def-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-72.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-72","revisionId":"euclid-10-72@raw-7784a7d0373e8f44","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"94f6f23a2c4e1edccf050891a8b1e480cf0549190dae9d8f42e77072d8a1835e","citations":["euclid-10-56"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But EF is rational; and, if an area be contained by a rational straight line and the third binomial, the side of the area is a second bimedial; [[X. 56](/principles/euclid-10-56)] therefore the side of EI, that is, of AD, is a second bimedial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但EF是有理;如果一个区域由有理线段和第三个二项无理线段组成,则该区域的另一边是第二个双中项无理线段;因此,EI的一侧,即AD的一侧是第二个双中项无理线段。 [[X. 56](/principles/euclid-10-56)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-72.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-72","revisionId":"euclid-10-72@raw-7784a7d0373e8f44","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4921d90e7fdc3ac25a66bd357d8932785713cb3a6e6e17b840176ab985206cca","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let the square on EH be greater than the square on HK by the square on a straight line incommensurable in length with EH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,EH的正方形比HK的正方形长,正方形长,EH长；上述对应量不可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-72.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-72","revisionId":"euclid-10-72@raw-7784a7d0373e8f44","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1f34875e23b43c97d93bee867047203628784e28565bd6d5663db0dff25a41bd","citations":["euclid-10-def-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now each of the straight lines EH, HK is incommensurable in length with EF; therefore EK is a sixth binomial. [[X. Deff. II. 6](/principles/euclid-10-def-10)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,EH,HK直线的长度为不可公度,EF,因此EK是第六条二项无理线段。 [[X. Deff. II. 6](/principles/euclid-10-def-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-72.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-72","revisionId":"euclid-10-72@raw-7784a7d0373e8f44","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e21abfd2d59bd06f5f66208e01505bd10b0d3d0eacb1942717e0db8f45bf09d7","citations":["euclid-10-59"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if an area be contained by a rational straight line and the sixth binomial, the side of the area is the side of the sum of two medial areas; [[X. 59](/principles/euclid-10-59)] so that the side of the area AD is also the side of the sum of two medial areas."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果一个区域由有理线段和第六二项无理线段组成,则该区域一侧是总和为2 中项无理线段个区域的一侧;因此,AD区域一侧也是总和为2 中项无理线段个区域的一侧。 [[X. 59](/principles/euclid-10-59)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-72.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-72","revisionId":"euclid-10-72@raw-7784a7d0373e8f44","order":17,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-72.source","contentId":"euclid-10-72","revisionId":"euclid-10-72@raw-7784a7d0373e8f44","order":18,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a1d96240db28910046a6f09397dc48ab8bb4ddcdf0bcd7c55abffb0b4fcbc82c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.72/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.72\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-72:euclid-10-22:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-72","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-72.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-22","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.72","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.72/","sourceLabel":"X. 22"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-72:euclid-6-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-72","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-72.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.72","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.72/","sourceLabel":"VI. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-72:euclid-10-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-72","sourceBlockIds":["eucl